The '''Great Mesra Plateau''' was a highland area of the [[desert]] [[planet]] of [[Tatooine]]. The [[city]] of [[Mos Eisley]] was located on the plateau, north of [[Anchorhead]].<ref name="Ultimate Star Wars" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The video game ''[[Star Wars Outlaws]]'' places the Great Mesra Plateau in the [[South Jundland Wastes]], south of [[Bestine (city)|Bestine]], rather than at Mos Eisley.

